.SBTTL	OMEGA	The Omega changes to RT-11 V5.4
;
; Assembled after EDTGBL in every part of the monitor.  Each module is one
; architectural difference of the Omega SJ monitor from DEC's; it defines
; macros only, and DEC's sources call them where Omega changed them (the
; hooks are the patches of patches/series).
;
